  "question": {
    "text": "If the mean deviation about median for the number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>24</mn></math>&nbsp;arranged in the ascending order, is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> then the median is",
